        {
          "id": 2412141312,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Implying this (I need to ~~see to believe~~ test) is valid for \"-e\" also(?):  \n> Custom columns can be defined using any valid field expression, such as display filter functions, packet slices, arithmetic calculations, logical tests, raw byte addressing, and protocol layer modifiers.  \n  \nI'll test and update the comment in `tshark.adoc` and push an updated commit.  \n  \nWSUG should be updated for `11.5.2. Columns`.  \n[6.2.1. Pop-up Menu Of The “Packet List” Column Header](https://www.wireshark.org/docs/wsug_html/#ChWorkColumnHeaderPopUpMenuSection) doesn't have a section to link to for column editing.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6701257,
            "username": "chuckcraft",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Chuck Craft",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0809ffc6d9d98013a1895132bc055c622830b8a20bfa49328f53d5eb4a1206cb?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/chuckcraft"
          },
          "created_at": "2025-03-23T23:58:12.206Z",
          "updated_at": "2025-03-26T07:21:19.325Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 371192851,
