        {
          "id": 2412153340,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Yep. For example, this is fine:\n\n`tshark -r test/captures/dhcp-nanosecond.pcap -T fields -e 'max(len(tcp.payload), len(udp.payload))' -e udp.payload#1[:4] -e 'udp.payload or tcp.payload'` \n\n```\n272\t01:01:06:00\t✓\n300\t02:01:06:00\t✓\n272\t01:01:06:00\t✓\n300\t02:01:06:00\t✓\n```",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
